###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - MTP accuracies on additional 4 ps AIMD test trajectories are in Supplementary Table S1, which is not part of the PDF; the main text says only that absolute-energy errors are 'in the order of a few meV'.
# - Thermal conductivities and interfacial conductances are properties, not error metrics. MTP levels and cutoffs are given only in the SI.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/mortazavi2020.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
